Server init.
>> a := Blob nua: 4.
a bytes: ( Liosta nua ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nua: 4.
b bytes: ( Liosta nua ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nua.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Aschur scríobh: ( a ^ c ), líne-nua. } gabh: { :e Aschur scríobh: e, líne-nua. }, tosaigh.
a saor.
b saor.
